2118326006||gls_level_penalty_help|How many levels below the enemies' level Geralt is scaled to when a fight starts: gear, vitality, attack power and sign intensity. At -10 against level 25 enemies, Geralt fights as level 15. Skills, mutations and potions are not affected. Geralt can't be scaled below level 1.
2118326007||gls_full_penalty_help|Geralt can't be scaled below level 1, so against low-level enemies your penalty can't be applied in full. Turn this on to keep it: the missing levels are applied as damage instead. Geralt's weapons and signs do less damage, and enemies hit harder.
